graph TD
    A[Open Dashboard tab] --> B{Data loaded?}
    B -->|No| C[Loading: skeleton headline + this-week + strip + 3 rows]
    B -->|Status endpoint failed| E[Error: neutral headline + Retry, still show local cash-flow number]
    B -->|New household, no data| F[Empty: SET UP headline + Link-an-account CTA]
    B -->|Yes| D[Populated dashboard]

    C --> D
    E -->|Retry| B
    F -->|Link an account| G[Link-account flow]

    D --> H{Solo or household?}
    H -->|Solo, members < 2| I[Me scope forced, no toggle, no avatars]
    H -->|Household| J[Household scope default, ScopeToggle + avatars shown]

    J -->|Tap 'Me'| K[Re-scope whole screen to current user]
    K -->|Tap 'Household'| J

    D --> L[Compute status: worst-signal-wins bills+spending+cashflow]
    L -->|all good| M[Green GOOD headline]
    L -->|one watch| N[Yellow WATCH headline]
    L -->|any alert| O[Red ALERT headline]

    D --> P{Attention items?}
    P -->|Non-empty| Q[Show AttentionCard under headline]
    P -->|Empty| R[Skip tier 2, this-week proof moves up]

    Q -->|Pay / Fix / Review| S[Item action -> refresh]
    D --> T[Tap this-week column -> Budget / Goals / Bills]
    D --> U[Tap trajectory strip -> Progress / Net-worth screen]
    D --> V[Tap 'See all' -> Transactions screen]
